entries.content:
By the coming [υπερ]. More correctly touching. Comp. Rom 9:27;

2Co 1:8. Uper never in N. T. in a formula of swearing.

Gathering together [επισυναγωγης]. Only here and Heb 10:25. The verb ejpisunagein is used, as the noun here, of the Lord 's gathering together his elect at his coming. See Mt 24:31; Mr 13:27; comp. 2 Macc. ii. 7.
